        "text": "Attacks a hero on a diagonal square as if the hero were next to it.",
        "kind": "ability"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "expansion": "Frozen Horror",
      "data": {
        "id": "fhSteal",
        "name": "Thief",
        "text": "Can steal one item from a hero instead of attacking (never the armor or shield they use, nor the weapon they wield), then runs away at full speed. If no hero can see it at the start of Zargon's turn, it escapes with the item: tap Escaped. If it is killed first, the hero gets the item back.",
        "kind": "ability"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "expansion": "Frozen Horror",
      "data": {
        "id": "fhHug",
        "name": "Bear hug",
        "text": "When its attack makes a hero lose at least 1 Body Point, it grabs that hero in a hug. At the start of each later Zargon turn the hero loses 2 Body Points, cannot defend and cannot act, and the Yeti makes no other attack. The hug lasts until the hero dies or the Yeti is killed.",
        "kind": "ability"
      }
    },
